# APIFY_TOKEN gives the scripts and Actors access to Apify. Create a personal API token in [Apify Console integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).
APIFY_TOKEN=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY gives the agent access to language models through OpenRouter. Create a key in [OpenRouter API keys](https://openrouter.ai/settings/keys).
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
